<title>UK: CSFP adds $50 mln to callable perpetual FRN.</title>
<headline>CSFP adds $50 mln to callable perpetual FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate, originally launched on February 13, has been increased to $200 million from $150 million, lead manager CSFB said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT SUISSE FINANCIAL PRODUCTS</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY  **PERPETUAL</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN   **+75 BP    PAY DATE    06.MAR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A2	  ISS PRICE  99.775    FULL FEES   75 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A+	  REOFFER    99.775</p>
<p> NOTES   ** CALL AT PAR IN MARCH 2007, WHEN COUPON STEPS UP TO</p>
<p>	   3M LIBOR +175 BP. CALLABLE EVERY FIVE YEARS THEREAFTER</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.50	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
